{
  "id": "prog-nsuns-531-lp-day-1",
  "title": "nSuns 5/3/1 LP – Day 1 (Bench volume + OHP)",
  "creator": "u/nSuns (r/Fitness)",
  "description": "nSuns' high-volume take on 5/3/1: every day has a nine-set T1 lift (a 5/3/1+ ramp then six back-off sets) and an eight-set T2 lift, all as percentages of a training max (start at 90% of 1RM), plus 2–4 accessories of your choice. Four days a week: bench+OHP, squat+sumo, bench+close-grip, deadlift+front squat. Weekly TM bump depends on the 1+ set: 0–1 reps none, 2–3 reps +2.5 kg, 4–5 reps +2.5–5 kg, 6+ reps +5–7.5 kg. Long sessions; the source gives no rest times (3 min T1 / 2 min T2 used).",
